  "notes": "This record covers the May 2024 release (API id gemini-1.5-flash-001); the September 2024 update is google.gemini-1-5-flash-002. Retirement differs by platform: Google Cloud retired gemini-1.5-flash-001 on 2025-05-24, while the Gemini API release notes record the shutdown of the gemini-1.5-flash id (then pointing to -002) on 2025-09-29 and the shutdown of the last 1.5 Flash 001 tuning model on 2025-05-27. No deprecation announcement date was found in live sources. GA date: release notes May 23, 2024; Google Cloud lists May 24, 2024; the developer post on the stable release is dated May 30, 2024."
